["Input: zero or more externally supplied values.","Output: at least one result.","Definiteness: each step is precise and unambiguous.","Finiteness: terminates after a finite number of steps.","Effectiveness: every step is basic enough to be carried out exactly.","Also desirable: correctness, generality, efficiency."],
