["Sequence: add costs.","if/else: cost of condition + max(branch costs) for worst case.","Single loop: n × body cost.","Nested independent loops: multiply.","Dependent inner loop: sum the series (e.g. n(n+1)/2).","Loop with i←i×2 or i←i/2 runs ⌊log₂ n⌋+1 times."],
